# The web image's context is the repository root (introduce-plugins decision 8). Only the app and each plugin's web
# part and manifest go in; the build itself installs node_modules.
*
!web/
!plugins/
plugins/*/*
!plugins/*/web/
!plugins/*/plugin.toml
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/coverage/
web/.vite/
**/*.log
